with obi-wan  watching over luke skywalker and  protecting him from a distance and with  luke being much younger here a child  actor was needed grant feely landed the  part and mark hamill was quick to offer  congratulations and support via twitter  writing grant feely looks like a perfect  luke skywalker and i am wishing him all  the very best now the young newcomer  hasn't changed that much since he filmed  his scenes as luke skywalker his first  role of real substance an appearance in  a music video aside feely only had one  acting credit prior to obi-wan kenobi in  an episode of the shutter series creep  show appearing as timmy in the timeout  segment  since his debut in the 1977 film star  wars luke skywalker has become one of  the most recognizable characters in  movie history  you can waste time with your friends  when your chores are done now come on  get to it  all right come on along with princess  leia and han solo luke skywalker is one  of the three major characters in the  original trilogy appearing in everything  from holiday specials to animated tv  shows video games comics and commercials  in star wars and you hope his first  on-screen appearance he's just a  teenager but he eventually transforms  into a skilled jedi with a mastery of  the mystical power known as the force  remember  the force will be with you always his  battles against darth vader and the evil  emperor palpatine are legendary  cinematic moments as are his  relationships with iconic characters  such as yoda r2d2 c-3po and obi-wan  kenobi but you may be surprised to learn  that mark hamill tried out for the role  of luke skywalker only after his friend  and roommate robert englund encouraged  him to do so england who you might  recognize from his role as the  terrifying freddy krueger in the  nightmare on elm street horror movie  series had been sitting in on some star  wars auditions when it occurred to him  that hamill would be a perfect fit for  luke and the rest as they say is history  on the inside of you nme podcast england  tells the story as only he can so my my  once upon a time in hollywood story is  that freddy krueger  told luke skywalker to call his agent  and he got the part and england was  right it's pretty much unimaginable  picturing anyone else but hamel in the  role of luke skywalker after playing the  part in the original star wars trilogy  he later reprised the role in the sequel  trilogy bringing the character full  circle but his death scene in star wars  the last jedi was hugely controversial  even hamel himself expressed surprise  over how it all went down telling den of  geek they totally hornswoggled me  amazing  every word of what you just said was  wrong  but he now seems to have made peace with  the project going on to say in that same  interview listen i never expected to  come back we had a beginning a middle  and an end that's what i said why mess  with it it's not something that worries  me because it's all about the new  generation as it should be in addition  to the classic films hamill also voiced  luke in the notable star wars radio  drama which aired on national public  radio way back in 1981 emmel went on to  collect many credits for his voice  acting career including his own beloved  take on the joker voicing him for  animated tv shows and video games alike  hamill also went on to do guest spots on  tv shows as varied as saturday night  live and the big bang theory but in the  end of course nothing can change the  fact that hamel is  was and forever will be the original  luke skywalker there's nothing for me  here now  i want to learn the ways of the force  and become a jedi like my father  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the star wars universe are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

